[64.068, "h its own complete forward\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mpass, one token at a time, in all commands. Fix it within the same rules and remaining step budget.\u001b[39m                   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Understood. The fix is to remove multi-position batching entirely, so every command, including prompts, FIXED and\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  LOGITS, runs one complete forward pass per position, in order. I'll look at the current forward and command code.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm swappi\u001b[14Gg\u001b[16G\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mforward_chunk\u001b[39m for a single-token \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mforward(token, pos)\u001b[39m built on \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mcblas_sgemv\u001b[39m,\u001b[91Gcalled once\u001b[103Gper position\u001b[117GThe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonly\u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mcblas_sgemm\u001b[20G\u001b[39mleft\u001b[25Gis\u001b[28Gin\u001b[31Glong-context\u001b[44Gattention,\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59Git\u001b[62Ghandles\u001b[70Gone\u001b[74Gquery\u001b[80Gposition\u001b[89Gat\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gtime.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b["]
[64.069, "22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBoth\u001b[8Gchecks pass. The\u001b[25Gscratch directory in /tmp has\u001b[55Gbeen cle\u001b[64Gred, s\u001b[71G I'll \u001b[78Gun the saved copies in\u001b[101G\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mprof/\u001b[107G\u001b[39minstead\u001b[115Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brebuild\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gv1\u001b[18Greference\u001b[28Gbinaries\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gcomparison\u001b[52Gscripts\u001b[60Gneed.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mListed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe comparison\u001b[18Gscripts rel\u001b[30Ged on v1 binaries l\u001b[50Gst with the deleted\u001b[70G/tmp\u001b[75Gdirectory,\u001b[86Gso\u001b[89GI'm\u001b[93Gwriting\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gdriver,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprof/refdrv.c,\u001b[18Gthat\u001b[23Gcompares\u001b[32Glogits\u001b[39Gand\u001b[43GENCODE\u001b[50Goutput\u001b[57Gdirectly\u001b[66Gagainst\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gsupplied\u001b[87Greference.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command\u2026\u001b[K\r\u001b[23C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m6\u001b[26G1\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H"]
