[201.242, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Understood. The fix is to remove multi-position batching entirely, so every command, including prompts, FIXED and\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  LOGITS, runs one complete forward pass per position, in order. I'll look at the current forward and command code.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm swappi\u001b[14Gg\u001b[16G\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mforward_chunk\u001b[39m for a single-token \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mforward(token, pos)\u001b[39m built on \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mcblas_sgemv\u001b[39m,\u001b[91Gcalled once\u001b[103Gper position\u001b[117GThe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bonly\u001b[8G\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mcblas_sgemm\u001b[20G\u001b[39mleft\u001b[25Gis\u001b[28Gin\u001b[31Glong-context\u001b[44Gattention,\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59Git\u001b[62Ghandles\u001b[70Gone\u001b[74Gquery\u001b[80Gposition\u001b[89Gat\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gtime.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBoth\u001b[8Gchecks pass. The\u001b[25Gscratch directory in /tmp has\u001b[55Gbeen cle\u001b[64Gred, s\u001b[71G I'll \u001b[78Gun the saved copi"]
